---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { primaryContact, telHref } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How DVATE handles information submitted through this website."
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy policy' }]}
  heading="Privacy policy"
  lede="Last updated November 1, 2026."
  cta={false}
>
  <section class="section theme-light">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>This policy explains what information DVATE collects through this website and how we use it.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you send a service request or email us, we receive the details you choose to share, such as your name,
        facility, role, email address, phone number, location and the services you are interested in.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is not intended for patient health information. Please do not send patient names, diagnoses or
        other protected health information through the website form or by regular email. Our clinical team will collect
        order details through a secure process.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Transfer Calculator on the Who we serve page runs in your browser. The numbers you enter there are not sent
        to us.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your request and contact you about our services</li>
        <li>To schedule visits and education sessions you ask for</li>
        <li>To improve this website and our communications</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your information.</p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We share information only with service providers that help us run this website and respond to you, such as
        email and form providers, or when the law requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website may use basic analytics to understand how visitors use it. These tools may set cookies. You can
        block cookies in your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can go to {primaryContact.name} at
        <a href={`mailto:${primaryContact.email}`}>{primaryContact.email}</a> or
        <a href={telHref(primaryContact.phone)}>{primaryContact.phone}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-left: max(var(--gutter), calc((100% - var(--wrap-max)) / 2));
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.3rem + 0.8vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .prose ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-block: 8px 16px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1359px) {
    .prose {
      margin-inline: auto;
      width: min(46rem, 100% - 2 * var(--gutter));
    }
  }
</style>
